      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201300703/2013007030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……夏葉がこの仕事、\r\n引き受けてくれてよかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "008"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013007030140,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "うふふ、私もよかったわ\r\nこんなに綺麗な場所に来られたもの",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300703/2013007030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013007030150,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "──ひとりじゃできないことだから、\r\nわからないけれど",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300703/2013007030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013007030160,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "またいつか、\r\nこんなドレス着る時がくるのかしらね……",
