    "text": "──ねえ、プロデューサー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300703/2013007030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013007030240,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "どうして結婚式で鐘を鳴らすか、\r\n知っているかしら",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300703/2013007030240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "鐘を鳴らす、理由か……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013007030250,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ……あの鐘は、\r\n幸せを呼ぶ平和の鐘なんですって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300703/2013007030250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013007030260,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "不幸を追い払って、幸福を呼ぶために──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300703/2013007030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013007030270,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "それから、式に来ることができなかった\r\n遠方の人にも想いが届くようにって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300703/2013007030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013007030280,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……鐘を、鳴らすのよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201300703/2013007030280"
  },
